OL,3,GNEWSAPolice seal off street after being
OL,4,Acalled to incident in Armadale
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have sealed off a street after
OL,7,Fbeing called to an incident at a house
OL,8,Fin Armadale, West Lothian.
OL,10,FOfficers were sent to the Harestanes
OL,11,FRoad area late in the afternoon on
OL,12,FSaturday.
OL,14,FThe area was cordoned off and police
OL,15,Fforensic officers in hazmat suits, some
OL,16,Fcarrying cameras, were seen at the
OL,17,Fproperty.
OL,19,FAmbulance crews and an air ambulance
OL,20,Fwere also at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
